aboutText("🧰 Ch2 Hub", 28, true)
aboutText("Ultimate Edition", 20, false)
aboutText("Ultimate DNA", 28, true)
aboutText("Ultimate is built on two V3-era cores rather than a single straight-line foundation. The OG V3 core is the version that defined what CH2 Hub became: its structure, identity and core workflow shaped everything that followed. The V3 Legacy / Remastered core represents the later return to that classic direction, preserving and refining the V3 identity instead of simply moving on from it. Ultimate carries both of those cores forward, then combines the ideas and lessons developed through V4, V5 and V5.1. That is why Ultimate is not simply another numbered release — it is a deliberate final edition built around the evolution, history and identity of CH2 Hub.", 112, false)
